<title>USA: American General Hospitality Corp Q1 net.</title>
<headline>American General Hospitality Corp Q1 net.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>For the Three Months Ended March 31, 1997 and 1996</p>
<p>							Actual    Pro Forma</p>
<p>					     Mar 31, 1997  Mar 31, 1996</p>
<p>     Total revenue			   $9,903,078  $6,535,783</p>
<p>Net income applicable to common</p>
<p>   stockholders				 4,053,481   2,667,256</p>
<p> Net income per common share		     0.34	  0.32</p>
<p>Weighted average number of shares of</p>
<p>   Common Stock outstanding		11,862,258   8,263,444</p>
<p>   Funds From Operations (FFO)	    6,674,707   4,765,991</p>
<p>Weighted average number of shares of</p>
<p>Common Stock and OP units outstanding</p>
<p>						   13,759,254  10,160,440</p>
<p> FFO per common share/OP unit		    0.49	  0.47</p>
<p>NOTE: Historical and pro forma information reported above is presented in accordance with the method utilized by industry analysts and includes the results of the company's initial 13 hotels for the full period and the actual results of acquired hotels from the dates of their acquisition.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
